AtlasGB — tooling licence
=========================

This repository is licensed in two parts, and the boundary is a path:

    tools/**              MIT — this file
    schema/**             MIT — this file
    Makefile, .github/**  MIT — this file

    everything else       CC BY-SA 4.0 — see LICENSE-CC-BY-SA
                          (atlases/**, docs/**.md, docs/brand/**, README.md)

The **tooling and the schema are MIT** on purpose. The generator, the exporter,
the validator, the link checker and `tools/fetch-atlas.sh` are code other
projects should be able to lift without a second thought, and
`schema/atlas.schema.json` is what lets somebody produce an atlas that is
compatible with this one. Gating either of those would help nobody.

The **atlas content is CC BY-SA 4.0**: credit AtlasGB, and share derivatives of
the content alike. `docs/licensing.md` is the path-by-path table and the honest
longer answer — including what a licence over a set of facts can and cannot
claim.

Copies published under MIT before this change remain MIT, in whole. A grant
already made cannot be withdrawn.

